Follow [architecture](../recommendations/frontend/architecture.md).

The storefront uses Next.js 16, React 19, and TypeScript. Interface code lives in `src/fsd`. A file in `app/` only mounts a page from `src/fsd/pages`.

Layers: `app` (`@app`), `pages` (`@pages`), `widgets` (`@widgets`), `features` (`@features`), `entities` (`@entities`), empty `processes`, `shared` (`@shared`).

Redux Toolkit stores the cart, favorites, and session. TanStack Query stores server data. Axios lives in `src/fsd/shared/api/interceptors.ts`. `src/shared` and `src/main_pages` are the older layer.

Public routes: `/`, catalog, product, authors, cart, checkout, favorites, orders, profile, auth, faq, legal details. `/admin` is the author cabinet. `/moderation` covers catalog, orders, and users. `/super-admin` covers banners, catalog, faq, and users. `app/orders/[id]` is empty.

